vates the h1 rook\n- Maintains all my tactical options (I can still play Ng5 next move)\n- Follows the principle of "castle early"\n\nReason: Castling kingside is the most sound strategic choice. It gets my king to safety before launching attacks, activates my rook, and maintains flexibility. With my king safe, I can launch aggressive operations with Ng5 or d4 on the next move without worrying about my king\'s safety.\n\nAnswer: K: e1-g1'}
